  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 1.1,
      "end": 4.02,
      "en": "Hello everyone, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "大家好，欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.32,
      "end": 4.82,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.18,
      "end": 6.02,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 6.78,
      "end": 9.42,
      "en": "And today we are going back in time.",
      "zh": "今天我们要回到过去。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 9.88,
      "end": 13.0,
      "en": "That's right, we're visiting the 1950s.",
      "zh": "没错，我们正在参观 1950 年代。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 13.36,
      "end": 25.8,
      "en": "Alright so we are going to the year 1950 and well, we are going to look at some of the typical and common words and phrases that were used back in that year.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们将进入 1950 年，好吧，我们将看看当年使用的一些典型和常见的单词和短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 25.8,
      "end": 32.48,
      "en": "Yes, all of these words and phrases you might still hear today but they are really a little bit old-fashioned.",
      "zh": "是的，你今天可能仍然听到的所有这些单词和短语，但它们真的有点过时。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 32.85,
      "end": 37.19,
      "en": "Alright, so we have some words that we need to look at before we listen to our dialogue.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以在我们听对话之前，我们有一些话需要看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 37.31,
      "end": 40.23,
      "en": "So let's look at these words in Vocabulary Preview.",
      "zh": "所以让我们在词汇预览中看看这些词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 42.24,
      "end": 43.84,
      "en": "Vocabulary Preview.",
      "zh": "词汇预览。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 43.84,
      "end": 47.14,
      "en": "We have two words we're going to hear in the dialogue.",
      "zh": "我们将在对话中听到两个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 47.14,
      "end": 48.82,
      "en": "The first one, sock hop.",
      "zh": "第一个，袜子舞会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 49.84,
      "end": 50.16,
      "en": "Sock hop.",
      "zh": "袜子舞会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 50.84,
      "end": 51.24,
      "en": "A sock hop.",
      "zh": "袜子舞会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 51.84,
      "end": 55.33,
      "en": "Okay, now this is very old-fashioned and probably not used anymore.",
      "zh": "好的，现在这是非常老式的，可能不再使用了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 55.56,
      "end": 56.35,
      "en": "No, not used anymore.",
      "zh": "不，不再使用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 57.32,
      "end": 60.25,
      "en": "But a sock hop is a school dance.",
      "zh": "但是袜子舞会是一种学校舞会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 60.8,
      "end": 67.84,
      "en": "Okay so all the kids after school would get together and dance rock and roll in the gym or something.",
      "zh": "好的，所以所有放学后的孩子都会聚在一起，在健身房或其他地方跳舞摇滚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 67.84,
      "end": 72.2,
      "en": "And well, it's very popular and very common among American culture in those days.",
      "zh": "好吧，在那个时代，它在美国文化中非常流行和非常普遍。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 72.21,
      "end": 72.91,
      "en": "Yes, in 1950.",
      "zh": "是的，在 1950 年。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 73.59,
      "end": 77.23,
      "en": "So you would still maybe see this in a movie or something like that.",
      "zh": "所以你仍然可能会在电影或类似的东西中看到这一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 78.24,
      "end": 81.52,
      "en": "And our second word is still used today.",
      "zh": "我们的第二个词至今仍在使用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 81.52,
      "end": 82.6,
      "en": "Sadie Hawkins dance.",
      "zh": "萨迪霍金斯舞。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 83.04,
      "end": 84.6,
      "en": "A Sadie Hawkins dance.",
      "zh": "萨迪霍金斯舞。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 85.32,
      "end": 87.64,
      "en": "Alright, a Sadie Hawkins dance.",
      "zh": "好吧，萨迪霍金斯的舞蹈。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 87.64,
      "end": 94.34,
      "en": "So a Sadie Hawkins dance is a dance when the girls ask the guys to be their date.",
      "zh": "萨迪·霍金斯舞会是一种由女生邀请男生做舞伴的舞会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 94.72,
      "end": 98.36,
      "en": "Okay, so it's a party and the guys don't invite the girls.",
      "zh": "好吧，这是一个聚会，男生不邀请女孩。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 98.62,
      "end": 99.82,
      "en": "No, the girls invite the guys.",
      "zh": "不，是女生邀请男生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 99.94,
      "end": 103.8,
      "en": "Okay, so it's a little bit of a reverse of roles there.",
      "zh": "好的，所以那里的角色有点相反。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 104.32,
      "end": 105.32,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 105.32,
      "end": 106.32,
      "en": "That's interesting.",
      "zh": "真有意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 106.32,
      "end": 111.14,
      "en": "So in this case, the girls have to come up to the guys and say, hey, do you want to go to the dance with me?",
      "zh": "所以在这种情况下，女孩们必须走到男生面前说，嘿，你想和我一起去跳舞吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 112.08,
      "end": 112.3,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 113.08,
      "end": 117.8,
      "en": "Well, this still happens today in North America, so you will probably hear it sometime.",
      "zh": "好吧，这在北美今天仍然发生，所以你可能会在某个时候听到它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 117.8,
      "end": 120.46,
      "en": "And I guess now we could listen to a dialogue for the first time.",
      "zh": "我想现在我们可以第一次听对话了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 120.46,
      "end": 123.3,
      "en": "And it takes place at a high school.",
      "zh": "它发生在一所高中。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 124.56,
      "end": 132.76,
      "en": "Hey, Tracy, how are you doing?",
      "zh": "嘿，特蕾西，你好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 132.76,
      "end": 133.64,
      "en": "I'm swell, Sandy.",
      "zh": "我好得很，Sandy。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 134.3,
      "end": 136.98,
      "en": "Hey, listen, you want to go to the sock hop with me this Friday?",
      "zh": "嘿，周五要不要和我一起去校园舞会？"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 137.24,
      "end": 137.76,
      "en": "It'll be a blast.",
      "zh": "一定会很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 138.24,
      "end": 140.02,
      "en": "First of all, it's the Sadie Hawkins dance.",
      "zh": "等一下，那是萨迪·霍金斯舞会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 140.5,
      "end": 141.9,
      "en": "The girls got to ask the guys.",
      "zh": "得由女生邀请男生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 142.32,
      "end": 143.72,
      "en": "Also, all right.",
      "zh": "还有，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 143.72,
      "end": 144.94,
      "en": "So when are you going to ask me?",
      "zh": "那你打算什么时候约我？"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 145.28,
      "end": 146.62,
      "en": "I've had my eye on you for a while.",
      "zh": "我早就注意你了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 147.16,
      "end": 148.94,
      "en": "Hey, buddy, ease off my girl, man.",
      "zh": "喂，小子，离我女朋友远点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 149.34,
      "end": 150.68,
      "en": "Or do you want a knuckle sandwich?",
      "zh": "想吃拳头吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 151.16,
      "end": 153.52,
      "en": "Cool it, guys.",
      "zh": "你们俩冷静点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 153.52,
      "end": 156.9,
      "en": "Your girl says who says me, pipsqueak.",
      "zh": "你女朋友？谁说的？我说的，小矮子！"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 158.96,
      "end": 167.12,
      "en": "All right, so a little bit of a discussion over a girl.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以对一个女孩进行了一些讨论。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 167.12,
      "end": 167.4,
      "en": "Very common.",
      "zh": "很常见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 168.12,
      "end": 169.12,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 169.12,
      "end": 170.12,
      "en": "Yep.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 170.12,
      "end": 176.96,
      "en": "So we're going to be looking at some of these words that were maybe a little bit difficult in the dialogue in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "所以接下来，我们就在语言要点里看看对话中一些可能有点难的词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 176.96,
      "end": 177.41,
      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 179.33,
      "end": 182.83,
      "en": "Well, we've got five phrases and words from the dialogue.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们有来自对话的五个短语和单词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 183.2,
      "end": 187.32,
      "en": "Now, the first thing we heard was Sandy said, heya.",
      "zh": "现在，我们听到的第一件事是桑迪说，嘿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 187.32,
      "end": 188.32,
      "en": "Heya.",
      "zh": "嗨。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 188.32,
      "end": 189.32,
      "en": "Heya.",
      "zh": "嗨。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 189.32,
      "end": 189.59,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 190.32,
      "end": 193.32,
      "en": "Now, an interjection, a way of saying hi, but very old-fashioned.",
      "zh": "现在，一个感叹词，一种打招呼的方式，但很老式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 193.32,
      "end": 194.32,
      "en": "Heya.",
      "zh": "嗨。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 194.32,
      "end": 195.32,
      "en": "Yep.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 195.32,
      "end": 196.32,
      "en": "Basically, hi, you.",
      "zh": "基本上，嗨，你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 196.59,
      "end": 197.21,
      "en": "Or hey, you.",
      "zh": "或者嘿，你。"
    },
