      "en": "So heya.",
      "zh": "所以嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 200.32,
      "end": 201.71,
      "en": "I guess you would still use it today, though, right?",
      "zh": "不过，我猜你今天仍然会使用它，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 202.08,
