      "en": "Cool it.",
      "zh": "冷静点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 244.4,
      "end": 248.53,
      "en": "So, why don't we listen to some examples of cool it before we explain it.",
      "zh": "所以，我们不如先听几个 cool it 的例子，再来解释它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "start": 250.76,
