      "start": 553.72,
      "end": 554.95,
      "en": "You're pushing Susie too much.",
      "zh": "你对苏西逼得太紧了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 555.4,
      "end": 556.49,
      "en": "You need to ease off a bit.",
      "zh": "你需要放松一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 558.76,
      "end": 559.2,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 559.3,
      "end": 568.5,
      "en": "So it looks like you say this phrase ease off when somebody is putting pressure on you or doing something to you that they shouldn't.",
      "zh": "所以，当有人向你施压，或者对你做一些不该做的事时，你就可以说 ease off。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 568.66,
      "end": 568.8,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 569.64,
      "end": 572.44,
      "en": "Maybe they're being too intense or maybe annoying you.",
      "zh": "也许他们太激烈了，或者可能让你烦恼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 572.44,
      "end": 573.7,
      "en": "So you tell them, hey, ease off.",
      "zh": "所以你告诉他们，嘿，放松一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 574.04,
      "end": 574.24,
      "en": "Relax.",
      "zh": "放松点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 575.04,
      "end": 576.04,
      "en": "Stay back.",
      "zh": "退后。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 576.04,
      "end": 577.04,
      "en": "Stay away.",
      "zh": "远离。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 577.04,
      "end": 578.04,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 578.04,
      "end": 579.04,
      "en": "So ease off.",
      "zh": "于是放轻松。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 579.04,
      "end": 580.04,
      "en": "Ease off my girlfriend.",
      "zh": "离我女朋友远点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 580.04,
      "end": 580.94,
      "en": "Ease off the fatty foods.",
      "zh": "少吃点油腻的食物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 581.38,
      "end": 581.7,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 582.02,
      "end": 582.88,
      "en": "So take it easy.",
      "zh": "所以放轻松。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 583.06,
      "end": 583.7,
      "en": "Stay away from.",
      "zh": "远离。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 584.2,
      "end": 585.2,
      "en": "Yep.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 585.2,
      "end": 586.2,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 586.2,
      "end": 587.2,
      "en": "So some great phrases there.",
      "zh": "所以那里有一些很棒的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 587.2,
      "end": 601.72,
      "en": "I think it's a good idea for us to listen to our dialogue one more time and then we'll come back and talk a little bit more about the 1950s.",
      "zh": "我认为再听一次我们的对话是个好主意，然后我们会回来多谈谈 1950 年代。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 601.72,
      "end": 603.12,
      "en": "Hey Tracy, how are you doing?",
      "zh": "嘿，特蕾西，你好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 603.14,
      "end": 604.02,
      "en": "I'm swell, Sandy.",
      "zh": "我好得很，Sandy。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 604.76,
      "end": 607.36,
      "en": "Hey, listen, you want to go to the sock hop with me this Friday?",
      "zh": "嘿，周五要不要和我一起去校园舞会？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 607.66,
      "end": 608.12,
      "en": "It'll be a blast.",
      "zh": "一定会很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 608.62,
      "end": 610.4,
      "en": "First of all, it's the Sadie Hawkins dance.",
      "zh": "首先，这是萨迪霍金斯的舞蹈。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 610.9,
      "end": 612.28,
      "en": "The girls got to ask the guys.",
      "zh": "得由女生邀请男生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 612.58,
      "end": 613.14,
      "en": "Also.",
      "zh": "还有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 613.3,
      "end": 613.58,
      "en": "Oh, right.",
      "zh": "哦，对了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 614.04,
      "end": 615.32,
      "en": "So when are you going to ask me?",
      "zh": "那你打算什么时候约我？"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 615.64,
      "end": 617.0,
      "en": "I've had my eye on you for a while.",
      "zh": "我早就注意你了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 617.54,
      "end": 619.3,
      "en": "Hey, buddy, ease off my girl, man.",
      "zh": "喂，小子，离我女朋友远点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 619.74,
      "end": 621.04,
      "en": "Or do you want a knuckle sandwich?",
      "zh": "想吃拳头吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 621.96,
      "end": 623.88,
      "en": "Cool it, guys.",
      "zh": "你们俩冷静点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 623.88,
      "end": 624.22,
      "en": "Your girl?",
      "zh": "你女朋友？"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 624.88,
      "end": 625.22,
      "en": "Says who?",
      "zh": "谁说的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 626.44,
      "end": 627.28,
      "en": "Says me, pipsqueak.",
      "zh": "我说的，小不点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 633.29,
      "end": 633.75,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 633.75,
      "end": 636.11,
      "en": "So the 1950s, a nice era.",
      "zh": "所以1950年代，一个美好的时代。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 636.68,
      "end": 648.04,
      "en": "And this is the first of a small series that we're going to have of different words and phrases that were used back in the 1950s, 1960s, 1970s, et cetera.",
      "zh": "这是我们小系列的第一集，接下来我们还会介绍 1950 年代、1960 年代、1970 年代等时期使用的各种单词和短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 648.04,
      "end": 649.04,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 649.04,
      "end": 652.92,
      "en": "And a lot more time travel is coming up here in EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "EnglishPod 里还会有更多的时间旅行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 652.92,
      "end": 653.11,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 653.43,
      "end": 663.6,
      "en": "Because a lot of these phrases are still used and you might even see them in movies or if you're talking to somebody that was maybe born in these eras, they might even still use them today.",
      "zh": "因为许多这些短语仍然被使用，你甚至可能在电影中看到它们，或者如果你正在与可能出生在这些时代的人交谈，他们甚至可能今天仍然使用它们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 664.28,
      "end": 664.62,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 664.9,
      "end": 671.0,
      "en": "So do you guys know any English phrases or slangs from the 1950s?",
      "zh": "那么你们知道 1950 年代的英语短语或俚语吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 671.2,
      "end": 675.32,
      "en": "Why don't you visit our website at EnglishPod.com to tell us about it?",
      "zh": "你为什么不访问我们的网站 EnglishPod.com，来告诉我们呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 675.72,
      "end": 676.08,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 676.72,
      "end": 681.68,
      "en": "We'll see you guys there and also if you have questions or comments, please leave them on the comments section as well.",
      "zh": "我们在那里见，如果你有问题或意见，也请留在评论区。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 682.04,
      "end": 684.04,
      "en": "Well thanks for listening and until next time.",
      "zh": "谢谢你的收听，直到下一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 684.04,
      "end": 685.04,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
